message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: openfda-mcp-server
abstract: "Model Context Protocol (MCP) server for the openFDA API, providing adverse event reporting search across drugs, food, devices, and cosmetics; enforcement and recall records; drug labeling and approvals (NDA/ANDA), Orange Book products, and Complete Response Letters; device clearances (510(k) and PMA) and product classifications; NDC directory lookups; and field aggregation across all 24 openFDA endpoints."
type: software
authors:
